      <trans-unit id="rules_text" resname="rules_text" xml:space="preserve" approved="yes">
				<source>Only words with 2 or more characters are accepted
Max 200 chars total
Space is used to split words, "" can be used to search for a whole string (not indexed search then)
AND, OR and NOT are prefix words, overruling the default operator
+/|/- equals AND, OR and NOT as operators.
All search words are converted to lowercase.</source>
			<target state="final">Só son aceptadas palabras cunha lonxitude de entre 2 e 200 carácteres. O espazo úsase para separar palabras, para buscar unha frase enteira podemos utilizar "". Os operadores AND (E), OR (Ou) e NOT (NON) úsanse antes de cada palabra e substitúen ao operador por defecto. Os comandos +/|/- equivalen aos operadores AND / OR / NOT. Todas as palabras de procura son convertidas a minúsculas.</target></trans-unit>
